summary:
  A station that has one reading is not read again for thirty days.

history:
  One reading is not a station: the same day one read -14.8 where the survey
  had it at -21.1, and an advert in a reading's twenty seconds stood for the
  programme for a month.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      return e[3].length < KEEP || nowS - e[1] > STALE_S;

replace:
      return nowS - e[1] > STALE_S;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_one_more_reading_a_day_until_there_are_five.
  Line-neutral.
